  "releaseNotes": "Breaking changes and performance improvements\n* Rebuilt pixel conversion: removed per-byte Marshal P/Invoke, bitmap bits now unlocked in try/finally (fixes memory leak)\n* SIMD (Ssse3) color deinterleave with pointer fallback, ~2x faster decode\n* TargetFramework is now net8.0 only (no more netstandard2.0/net45)\n* Updated dependencies: ZXing.Net 0.16.11, System.Drawing.Common 4.7.3 (GHSA-rxg9 security fix)\n* Decoder now preserves the original line endings of the encoded payload",
